# FinnOS application registry
#
# The catalogue of apps the OS knows about. It ships with the OS and says what
# each app is called, what it looks like and what runs it — never whether it
# is on this machine. The installer writes /var/lib/finn/installed.
#
# Format: id | Name | icon | command | note | source
#
#   id       the name the rest of the system uses
#   Name     what the user sees
#   icon     an SVG in /usr/share/finn/icons
#   command  what to run when the app is launched
#   note     free text, shown as the app's detail line
#   source   catalogue origin: (empty) native, flatpak, winget

settings | Settings | settings-app.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-settings | Settings
files | Finn Files | files.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-files | File manager
terminal | Finn Terminal | terminal.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-terminal | Terminal emulator
notes | Finn Notes | notes.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-notes | Notes and text editor
store | Finn Store | store.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-store | Software, Flatpak & Windows apps
viewer | Finn Viewer | viewer.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-viewer | Image and SVG viewer
monitor | Finn Monitor | monitor.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-monitor | System activity and processes
calculator | Finn Calculator | calculator.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-calculator | Standard and scientific calculator
archive | Finn Archive | archive.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-archive | Archive manager for zip and tar
capture | Finn Capture | capture.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-capture | Screen capture and screenshots
flourish | Flourish | flourish.svg | /usr/local/bin/finn-flourish | Arc-inspired Chromium web browser
